# Normalize all text to LF in the repo and in the working tree.
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks everything out
# as CRLF, which makes `npm run format:check` fail on every file and hides
# CRLF-handling bugs from CI (which only ever runs on Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
